{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:15c9ecf724aa777b9043b9eced793cac7886daeadece64863d7b6a05d28bdc02",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8035a4be3fe365598a101e59b382b8f272c8e7a9260d3dc974c01026aea0daab",
      "text": "遗忘的过去",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c841079108b8929d97523405a86741823330dd8011e38fcf8363351316c25ef",
      "text": "决定成为偶像的涟，在梦境中\n重温了过去的经历。与武的相遇、\n与身为师父的父亲的分别、与道流的相遇……\n做完那个梦的数日后，涟与道流一同造访了事务所，\n逼着对方立刻举行试镜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_a:cmd-000012:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a0c7f8f83c9759bf38e90e810580beff52236c88683724b5c13d354d17d97d",
      "text": "第3话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_a:cmd-000012:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8035a4be3fe365598a101e59b382b8f272c8e7a9260d3dc974c01026aea0daab",
      "text": "遗忘的过去",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39c26971fa1504515c4271785fc2e2d675e46dd2250be13854dfa06e5b151c5d",
      "text": "……切。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bdbb6a2125bd856d70eb405cc690184173122293523c35933439096f1054e71",
      "text": "（为什么拉面店的今天不休息啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2dbea7abf88c77cbc0c5c2903ac48a8e01b29c000c06a0b7cedb8f4e8e8cc913",
      "text": "（说什么本大爷一个人不能参加试镜，\n监护人什么的，本大爷哪管那些啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_a:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9d902791f7eaa6687c96ac773cadd4ea8713bfac5eaefa39bc8c648ec296ac8",
      "text": "（麻烦死了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f33f9228a01b6eebc5dfa2cbcf3be170b9cf2e9429d196751cf90611532ae877",
      "text": "（但是只要成为偶像，就能和小不点做个了断了。\n终于能把那时候的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_a:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:659337746746782cdcfdf0d03d04ea384a64a1c7d04785edf7aee956b4b05a6a",
      "text": "哈～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_a:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0e146d672ab9554578f739cee14496d2d46de6641997c914fd9ef043ae09b14",
      "text": "（好困……\n在拉面店那里吃得太饱了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_a:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46dcbf38fb06fe4363971044af3c6f6f7cee3dc8e0484c1692f4701e05dc69e4",
      "text": "……呼噜噜……呼啊——……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:900c64e3e87f80dfdfd4cdef4eefd6c0b3d2ad0b7a110af2e3612cc8a779a634",
      "text": "（“天才拳法少年·牙崎涟。\n再次以最年轻记录斩获大会冠军”……吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77401c5a0459768b4c8ec79a51a8d82e97f8d68c907df5ec88b769d58e931011",
      "text": "（怎么可能有赢得了本大爷的家伙啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d79b45ab60760d22fc039035bed592220673fcc078d6c023ab10e682a2653c6",
      "text": "……刺拳……\n直拳……刺拳……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ae1a421e565d8853480715b837528711e1e2f8f458fbd1487cf05865fda8ca0",
      "text": "……！好痛……石子？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_b:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a9f178f5470e9ab16a0bb85bd28effacd76e8bb6ea5133745198a6c5e287906",
      "text": "刺拳……刺拳……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_b:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40cc327d19a6a65038b00dcfdbb345a494b43536bc20562c5d968d597a24cd22",
      "text": "喂，你！给我等一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_b:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17b007487a569aa86b8fe19daa90c496c59cf6ee72759235bf85bf9da8ac06b3",
      "text": "刺拳……\n直拳！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_b:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d7c4687ac42328d867711da1580e4663727c4f06eb1f54ab9f3f09f16aa87e5",
      "text": "啊？\n抱歉，打到你了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_b:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a221dc81d612f781ad869d396debc6071f000aca9fdf6a890e3b9e79ffcf6492",
      "text": "喂，你没事吧！？喂！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_b:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f92f0d00ff66c018da9abb48dcfaa91a5e4f1b059056d4dd61afe395e6dcb81",
      "text": "（……可恶！\n这个小不点到底怎么回事……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f59370e5e5556cbee14db60533593c485cfeb0b35604275db9f0ceebba03b68",
      "text": "这是何等难看的模样。涟。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23fa3e6c54244a9373b11656d60ea31bfa875bedd2062c5c8eaaf392efa895b3",
      "text": "……啊？老爸……？\n！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7d948c4c26dd7d8b55f285e4a4c196c8676847fbde9b45c2578a3489e5f7cea",
      "text": "对了，那家伙！那个小不点在哪里！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:548a4fcc76190d0fe62e97ca39a8e8d8b7280a0cecc143e481d1391a7da15e7c",
      "text": "那个少年的话，把你托付给我之后就离开了。\n你败北了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87ebed941f4425a872617c2788c6986a201b879fe1ec8d871eb707ed6fa0031d",
      "text": "开什么玩笑！\n本大爷才没有输给那家伙！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:040a5d00192c6c67f809c16eb607ff8c7e41d20df580fda950d5e2fee84d2884",
      "text": "我应该说过。\n禁止与外流派交手、禁止私斗、禁止败北。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_c:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bda8d3a96179c725968373ca3edfe7cae3110dae1e66f2cee7649b53c9dd9c0",
      "text": "那根本不算比赛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9974f96d3f203ebdb26605474b159f526396a9ceea0545760d8cc937618ce7f4",
      "text": "无论经过如何，私斗与败北都是不可饶恕的。\n你被逐出师门了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_c:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a7a7e286d5b380a3291d6cdf63d8dc6f8273f82edfae16fd2d940e0dbd356ff",
      "text": "哈啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_d:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:317229e91d6ba6c45fca0754c38138394d350a2ce70fd3adb92a0ba939ef01dc",
      "text": "数个月后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31f2e1ee5b59db1b6fc8b4f409cbfd23489d27c9ddebbc59566392ce9e7b381b",
      "text": "啧……刚才的对手，也不怎么样嘛。\n所以，下一个是谁？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92cfe076b663e9dd4720feec2b17dac586cee40d59b489e02677ad32595cb9d7",
      "text": "是我！虽说你还是个小鬼，但我可不会手下留情！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_d:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01505a81447bf396be3033825c205fb3125fe4b02c4e311c1e75ee7b45cf7424",
      "text": "……哼。啰啰嗦嗦吵死了。\n赶紧给我开始！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_d:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:308a1edd7a0e666e4cafc6b5488f5496c9a2d40f47f91b2fabeb2b4eeb8969c7",
      "text": "刚才那股威风劲去哪儿了？\n……看招！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_d:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec755ee69a6cfb2aacbe2f2be9ef3c16051b009c0d652abb2632470eb1f6116b",
      "text": "嘎啊！呜呜……这小鬼到底是怎么回事！\n有谁能打得赢这种家伙啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_d:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d21bfdd06d95311a7aea22fea82b5d6575573e142cfb17713707a1235e40bbe2",
      "text": "哈，这就已经累瘫了吗？\n连热身运动都算不上……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_d:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f173323d14dadd3f5e23e905d14a1c8626b5d0312e1727e46575b62b712acae",
      "text": "（杂鱼、杂鱼、杂鱼！全都是杂鱼）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_d:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4981b26e6379ff5afcdb62fd53dedcef81a8e9da7018e234fa44d01953a3a359",
      "text": "（就算没有老爹教我，本大爷也是最强的。\n遇到那个小不点的时候也是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_d:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61185aba76b6f5d1f681055dd5cf15df406a495b568df805d958281c6d32a39a",
      "text": "（还要更强。我要变得更强更强，\n一直赢下去……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_d:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c3325bb7500df01ef940240d82f805dc2d37e5ebbc1ca53a800115f2f08c69a",
      "text": "（然后把那个小不点彻底打倒！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_e:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f41789a3f975725f965b9e44a78df3c090c2e74399319f3374cc0492972ca458",
      "text": "数年后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4b87821b5b7f5b814a7e46abbedcd4f109831dee65c3bb9bc5d86bf398aa7ca",
      "text": "库哈哈！喂，这就结束了吗？\n本大爷还能打呢。站起来啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42fd08531bf428b55db8afc33eab48bc51b2ae523f482e9b2f3d424b23c1143e",
      "text": "噫……对不起……\n请放过我吧……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_e:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c53096aba014ccf04ebbdda372485d1636e9a722d09b4f5f9e635c11667d9387",
      "text": "滚吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9fa99c6dd258a8cd89e615b8b414b6edd477c0530f1106834cd42e613ee2288",
      "text": "（这里的杂鱼怎么可能比得过本大爷）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0ff698944e2c5158af0b22dc411d586b01da6a300cc5110bb1b5388b1b850c1",
      "text": "（就算是那个小不点，我也一拳就能撂倒！\n……到底在什么地方啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_e:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_e:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98739b95ccd71250c93eb093e8d38baf3f898a648b1a0e49967a79cf39a4611a",
      "text": "……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_e:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b7162f834b17902a1e22fae2e9e67532f8da0dbc425d1ac8da26f435f5b548b",
      "text": "（那家伙是！\n虽然模样变了，但就是那个时候的小不点！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_e:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58ea541a091edd3bed4b1d5c6cbc57898bfebfccb0545b8b65d98905805953cc",
      "text": "喂，你！给我等一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_e:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df3885e27adf41975ce2dd4035839977489aae75c54430ee66d2ce4af89ae624",
      "text": "嗯？是谁啊……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_e:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9df11764787ac30aaee9005982dd4795cfa782d1c1e800f073bad6141c2bfbd",
      "text": "（这家伙！竟然不记得本大爷了吗！？\n……可恶！！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_e:cmd-000166:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a597dfbd1912c0443643837f3401be646d053131ed516e1fd41d8f160a318bf6",
      "text": "小不点！给本大爷决一胜负吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_f:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0a629c175d8cf145fe5ad93c431e828d0ea991cc2e06d15bb75d8b51024f33a",
      "text": "别东躲西藏的，放马过来啊！\n哈。难道是被本大爷吓破胆了？逊毙了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_f:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b5f2e113419e8ac0a392217722d29543608067c8d49c7840b4993ee3123973e",
      "text": "这家伙搞什么……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_f:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab388579b8be7f4e92cb9a67247bbf4375fd07cd06f868f6a59398bf9aec019b",
      "text": "（这家伙，非同一般。但是，要对普通人\n动手的话，最坏的情况会丢掉拳击手资格）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_f:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:511eeb2eb8b83003a1654f167e0a4c2a9b67573cb23079ce2a2caea625cdb39d",
      "text": "（只有这个绝对不行。我还没有见到弟弟）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_f:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4918677a68f535d563e2e792fd5761c5fbdaff8c5aecf781b320c82bcb6dc59",
      "text": "喂！到此为止了，你们两个！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_f:cmd-000166:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79d52e5db5bf52304a5928799f4795587a17317b74801930b1ef161b4d878881",
      "text": "可恶，放开我！\n别来碍事！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_f:cmd-000177:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94cf8a6d7e250e480075f2833fb2bbfdf67147bd2d57e6bbe8cfe5958c585334",
      "text": "（搞什么啊，这家伙！\n居然这么轻易就绕到了本大爷身后）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_f:cmd-000187:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28947b08a35c3a9485cc8f8aa353e65a16b8688a3665525ad32d3f93c79fde9e",
      "text": "圆城寺先生！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_f:cmd-000203:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07a3bb852b1aba9ec40c045b261728b3241ba86608b8d5ec63c772bb4619f0ff",
      "text": "喂，别乱动。先冷静下来。\n我只是想知道你们打架的理由而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_f:cmd-000219:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcf7911e4a1fee8d230ed5c69cfcfe54a39f4cfc1e6be2a404d05b3646009f6b",
      "text": "不是打架。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_f:cmd-000221:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2d9821fff39774d92ff46b28e5a13a9d50bb93829834884a5875a0dd56739fb",
      "text": "武，发生什么事了？\n看起来你像是被单方面攻击了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_f:cmd-000229:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:577774834ac02c68e31ea5277d29c662b02682e17d35d3f6d7a5f8ef6498f7ca",
      "text": "这家伙突然来找我挑战。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_f:cmd-000237:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bca07aa3157fbffc3dbbe0b7862770f91fa6c3be56944d9815e21caaaa6322c",
      "text": "原来如此。\n总之，你们两个，先来店里吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_f:cmd-000241:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:529416ae46fd1e3828a5568457758e08b717546e359f442f055d747b7ac45374",
      "text": "吃饱肚子之后再慢慢聊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_g:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f5d8460c5388207ec0f4b5a054c3b6511558ddcd19962d38514bd96f9101c9c",
      "text": "除了名字之外什么都不肯说，是吗。\n武，你对涟有印象吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_g:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8829487c66fd9a29a02e059663ad6eb3f985f5a6d2b00b02a9143991d0fc3f46",
      "text": "完全没有。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_g:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:330836771221ab3dc47cfd21964fba798821cd0d136d0495295aaa3b351ab202",
      "text": "哈啊？小不点连脑子都这么小啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_g:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af5594793483f9f79b81fa41c8487c6db7b29792471ee0d7fca4d577222073e0",
      "text": "听好了？我绝对会打倒你，\n让你明白本大爷才是最强的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_g:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:630e75ca77754049d3f201ba047851c57039bb3376cf34bea49dc909a780843f",
      "text": "我没有理由和你打。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_g:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:110e54535ec8aef2638fff16f282bcad1fbbc8a1a11d6ed559a437ddd0e5d88b",
      "text": "啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_g:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7953d17cd12e249ab67c98b0befc4d8aa9f44cd40af9701e24438d672041c7b5",
      "text": "哎呀呀。你们两个，可千万别受伤啊。\n总之，今天先吃了我家的拉面再回去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_g:cmd-000083:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_g:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddbea710bc608aa8fd9fde3f5df076b999a687893d828ce41bc005257bb878de",
      "text": "好，备料完成！\n到开店时间为止来开发下新菜单……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_g:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7f82c7266ca7e6e952efc935bae57bdbad7240200d826250aa89e52ddd875a1",
      "text": "唔……！\n……武、涟！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_g:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:578d33cc94faeb9fe025f47d834a62d0e7579562369cceac3be77e2552331bc3",
      "text": "为什么你总是在逃啊！？\n赶紧给我堂堂正正地打一场！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_g:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90b8ac35a6d19b73f8695bbbd95c3f6fceef399c57ee28acd3cbd4bc4b640f43",
      "text": "住手，别在这种地方胡闹！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_h:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5282bbd14260f3e3b62afe8f06e89819891218696927bdfe50e4aa3c36bf45c8",
      "text": "到此为止了。涟、武！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_h:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc2282234f254ce6e98776c971c86ea119cb48ab02e9966b8b8ba67402fca800",
      "text": "你这家伙……唔，住手，放开我！\n别妨碍本大爷！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_h:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20b69608b56c1c60f31e099c16616bd2388bed96974efebfe030bbc568e69e86",
      "text": "放开你的话，你又要开始打架了吧。\n你们两个都给我听好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_h:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c2e8e4225435776f55ab89b15ce32b6cc61624870c1cbdf68157ed33a5460bf",
      "text": "……有精神是好事。\n但是，给别人添麻烦这种事可不行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_h:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e31e0dba7f2dca36c43e811bd253caf2222459522cdccd27604407e3cbf9b1a",
      "text": "看看门口。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_h:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:989f92b931f564a967f4a7c0e9bcd7275d7bb2176800a07c638107b6d60749ad",
      "text": "要是刚才有人在的话，\n可就酿成大祸了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_h:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1218e4a79e2bc52381c4546844ed9207454e98aeef10a4195742b54bcdfd66a5",
      "text": "啧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_h:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bd69474c66d466326b3aaa0d9bcfc96bc03cae4126a4358ee7279dbcffa191f",
      "text": "圆城寺先生，对不起。\n我现在就收拾。……修门的钱，我也会想办法出的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_h:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0ec7cec90a63e1862551b3b8309f12568eece68fa325178ba042fff63cfa752",
      "text": "修理费的事别放在心上。以后比完赛像平时那样\n再来店里吃拉面就好啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_h:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41d2e76e82aff48cca85d4f39830e69e076abd2f9c6876b063fbe8c151b40877",
      "text": "我有话要跟涟谈谈。\n武，你能先回去吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_h:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63366a6f416a31067425a48d1badf3e9cc28003554a7b3ee1518b46a2ed973c2",
      "text": "……知道了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_h:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9bbb015b19a3559c9890495290aff9fe5749e591dca01003f38bdbc0f8b4c4a",
      "text": "放开我！\n既然小不点不在了，那我在这里就没事可干了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_h:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13f991eb4aa53a87d7a313b194b0cb30bf76833c683fc3fd85d925729af7d605",
      "text": "……我说，涟。\n你为什么，那么执着于要和武打一场呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_h:cmd-000156:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9910b6f6e9d22cf5853e9eb6752c530676314ef9dee743c2daab49a0aa0c4d97",
      "text": "打扰了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_h:cmd-000167:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7357b88f50ed712e73d3b3ab10ea3ea97cadc33ea7702c977310082b996a9349",
      "text": "啊，不好意思。现在还没到营业时间，\n能请您稍后再来吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_h:cmd-000175:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:531357de4b9a96b524f92d369068467c00f6c7eac405803d2f7528d58295ef17",
      "text": "……臭老爹！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_h:cmd-000180:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e75935c07ca4840bc3c7e17901d08406fc9e0567db1b37fc85784f7f5c1b477",
      "text": "涟的父亲……！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_i:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec483a357d8b5c8d154fdffce2044ee0d7d6ee8dcc1285607f4fc514123c65db",
      "text": "涟，这一片狼藉是怎么回事？\n我应该严禁过你私斗吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_i:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb958733232ca762ee2dc30e765d0223febbdf21eb86ad2fdc7de6829ca5fee5",
      "text": "少对本大爷指手画脚！\n反正已经跟你没关系了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_i:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99bb04af91d4477bd98c2d46d4324cb94ef7331a85388cf0daa2fa0981f1ea9e",
      "text": "纠正前弟子的过错，是师父的责任。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_i:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4e73178bf2d40e64bc2cb6080514dff9d666ce5a9eb154b2ad496c5323a7166",
      "text": "吵死了！！谁是你弟子啊！\n早就什么关系都没有了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_i:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7618fc41d81ed7559ee2092354f02407beafba84064342d7cf4b091d5fdd44a2",
      "text": "咕……！\n……可恶…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_i:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52392e29b76d460e885c91a178a2a46ab093189a3ed4b0e4aaeeac288f1bcbfc",
      "text": "（直到把涟击昏为止的那套动作，没有一丝多余。\n这个人一定是个赫赫有名的格斗家……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_i:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:516f6e437f6733e1c739e3f39e6fb02f3c8f5e79d22bb38dfa485fcc450610ea",
      "text": "我过会儿就会回来。\n有话想和你谈谈。请等我一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_i:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a38a2e8e7210e9f199a02e129ec84b923928db60f700746fb978a754e0663d1",
      "text": "知道了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_i:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:701ff82f9a23a215fb29667c5679648a7fda1908560e970fa6d759669497d7ab",
      "text": "（两人是父子。应该没什么问题，\n但他带着涟到底是要去干什么……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_i:cmd-000143:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_i:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14be46586173c43468a7ec62897cb04f12a8228d521092932c6a2e8c3a7dab8b",
      "text": "您回来了。\n涟还没有醒过来呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_i:cmd-000161:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dde01caf7416581778e9e5ab071ff0324c2dd1684cb70e0b8f099a6d6289740c",
      "text": "暂时还会保持这样一阵子吧。\n……抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_i:cmd-000167:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7eadbc0e48c999c10fea8fd5539cf9642f4dfc96daa29133560f7b32588d989",
      "text": "因为我行动太迟，至今为止给你添了不少麻烦。\n这是店里的修理费。请什么都别说收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_i:cmd-000170:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39520d3019fdf13af4f703305d352e54c58afe39d497399a76e33084b623122c",
      "text": "您想跟我谈的是什么事？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_i:cmd-000172:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b8fa1577903421a91e6910bcbab2e1cee44436735d840a9c3641ef3e784d0b3",
      "text": "涟今后也会继续向那个青年挑战吧。\n作为届时能阻止他的人，我想把涟托付给你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_i:cmd-000178:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02690845e29c3c57b2709b26a3a3097e88e24bb170073ef079c39c53d990ad24",
      "text": "你的实力我也略有耳闻。\n……这要求实在自私，非常抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_i:cmd-000184:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fd4a116a0e4bfe2ca5f1c4d78322720dbff19986a91cf282960c656a511a9a3",
      "text": "我本来也是这么打算的。\n武和涟对我来说都像弟弟一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_i:cmd-000190:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d07225e355cad65c044819fda0733892c5e84fcea6096886a9e5ba742862088",
      "text": "我是一路承蒙周围人们的善意才活到今天的。\n所以，这次轮到我来这么做了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_j:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a66a3140600a4d0077d54105c2b34f1a940bafc78a78d4c0da7cccfbd531a42",
      "text": "……啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_j:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b18014d0f86a057a04e7af22b698536ebbfa39c59df5bf9632a93c327e747951",
      "text": "啧……竟然梦到遇到小不点那时候的事了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_j:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b840ff0a225043d58a70bba3cb4ad7c6243558fa5c9ae6a7483ae6aa5127019",
      "text": "好像，还有其他火大的事情来着……\n啧，想不起来了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_j:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9fad12bf8b0e97419e05eae6331ae82449632492994a244519f74d36a1099eb",
      "text": "明明是个小不点，\n连在梦里都要惹本大爷心烦吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_j:cmd-000050:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_j:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea2f943e21a89a81f19675c7f1ec71481c535fe2af604f5271d11d99820be77d",
      "text": "喂，现在立刻给本大爷办试镜！\n本大爷想快点当上偶像啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_j:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0d42978c443e74ec766ad5108ac39059efc705474282cc3716c180ce2fe7ae3",
      "text": "没想到您这么想成为偶像……！\n涟先生的热情我已经充分感受到了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_j:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c2eb495a1381e7a4c97cfaad4fa4a32977590054e257deb1d33ed1c7b15be8b",
      "text": "……但是，在武先生和道流先生参加的那天之前，\n并没有安排其他试镜日程。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_j:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64e1deb222de851b4c2fcf5fd3d501aad46286518f453e0f38a8de48581efe53",
      "text": "本大爷才不管那些！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_j:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da3a4a6b38462b4db9c6f36dd45ac05b386fe7e8be94d990c2989a98e195531a",
      "text": "涟，这么想怎么样？就当是\n多出了为成为偶像而特训的时间。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_j:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:110e54535ec8aef2638fff16f282bcad1fbbc8a1a11d6ed559a437ddd0e5d88b",
      "text": "啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_03_1_1_013_03:1_1_013_03_j:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95febe55aac50018a7ba3eb5391148a1c4d3171bd2d3764024dcd7c43a740c19",
      "text": "格斗家为了准备比赛都会锻炼自己对吧？\n同样的，要不要和我还有武一起特训？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
